begin="1:46.055" end="1:47.025">有一张稚气的</span><span begin="1:47.025" end="1:47.251">脸</span></p><p begin="1:47.261" end="1:52.221" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:47.261" end="1:47.512">泉</span><span begin="1:47.512" end="1:47.712">水</span><span begin="1:47.712" end="1:48.216">渗透</span><span begin="1:48.216" end="1:48.466">进</span><span begin="1:48.466" end="1:48.699">矿</span><span begin="1:48.699" end="1:49.027">层</span><span begin="1:49.027" end="1:49.375">岩</span> <span begin="1:49.560" end="1:50.019">爷爷栽</span><span begin="1:50.019" end="1:50.459">种</span><span begin="1:50.459" end="1:51.470">的樟木树苗在</span><span begin="1:51.470" end="1:52.221">上面</span></p></div><div begin="1:52.371" end="2:04.243" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:52.371" end="1:55.170" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:52.371" end="1:52.899">犹记得</span><span begin="1:52.899" end="1:53.688">那年</span>  <span begin="1:53.817" end="1:54.350">在一个</span><span begin="1:54.350" end="1:55.170">雨天</span></p><p begin="1:55.180" end="1:59.240" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:55.180" end="1:55.700">那七岁</span><span begin="1:55.700" end="1:56.449">的我</span><span begin="1:56.449" end="1:57.033">躲在屋</span><span begin="1:57.033" end="1:57.329">檐</span>  <span begin="1:57.329" end="1:57.697">却一</span><span begin="1:57.697" end="1:58.042">直</span><span begin="1:58.042" end="1:58.524">想去荡</span><span begin="1:58.524" end="1:59.240">秋千</span></p><p begin="1:59.449" end="2:04.243" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:59.449" end="1:59.996">爷爷抽</span><span begin="1:59.996" end="2:00.694">着烟</span>  <span begin="2:00.862" end="2:02.137">说唐朝陆羽写茶</span><span begin="2:02.137" end="2:02.412">经</span><span begin="2:02.412" end="2:02.683">三</span><span begin="2:02.683" end="2:03.054">卷</span>  <span begin="2:03.054" end="2:03.395">流传</span><span begin="2:03.395" end="2:03.606">了</span><span begin="2:03.606" end="2:03.856">千</span><span begin="2:03.856" end="2:04.243">年</span></p></div><div begin="2:04.305" end="2:15.596" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="2:04.305" end="2:09.836" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:04.305" end="2:04.950">那天</span>  <span begin="2:04.950" end="2:05.111">我</span><span begin="2:05.111" end="2:05.439">翻</span><span begin="2:05.439" end="2:05.666">阅</span><span begin="2:05.666" end="2:06.252">字典</span>  <span begin="2:06.252" end="2:06.496">查</span><span begin="2:06.496" end="2:06.877">什</span><span begin="2:06.877" end="2:06.981">么</span><span begin="2:06.981" end="2:07.624">字眼</span>  <span begin="2:07.624" end="2:07.885">形</span><span begin="2:07.885" end="2:08.908">容一件</span><span begin="2:08.908" end="2:09.415">事</span>  <span begin="2:09.415" end="2:09.836">很遥远</span></p><p begin="2:09.846" end="2:13.643" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:09.846" end="2:10.443">天边</span>  <span begin="2:10.633" end="2:10.795">是</span><span begin="2:10.795" end="2:11.102">否</span><span begin="2:11.102" end="2:11.265">在</span><span begin="2:11.265" end="2:11.894">海角</span>  <span begin="2:11.894" end="2:12.363">对</span><span begin="2:12.363" end="2:13.643">面</span></p><p begin="2:12.831" end="2:15.596" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v2000"><span begin="2:12.831" end="2:13.426">直到九</span><span begin="2:13.426" end="2:13.764">岁</span><span begin="2:13.764" end="2:14.143">才知</span><span begin="2:14.143" end="2:14.458">道</span><span begin="2:14.458" end="2:14.796">浪费</span><span begin="2:14.796" end="2:15.596">时间</span></p></div><div begin="2:15.206" end="2:26.737" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="2:15.206" end="2:18.430" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:15.206" end="2:16.510">这茶桌樟木的横切</span><span begin="2:16.510" end="2:16.955">面</span>  <span begin="2:16.955" end="2:18.019">年轮有二十三</span><span begin="2:18.019" end="2:18.430">圈</span></p><p begin="2:18.440" end="2:21.182" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:18.440" end="2:19.437">镜头的另一</span><span begin="2:19.437" end="2:19.640">边